{"nodes": [{"id": "document_8ab55efe4f14", "label": "v3/artefact/data/README.md \u2014 what `herb-eval.dump` is and how to restore it", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "v3/artefact/data/README.md", "source_location": "c:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\v3\\artefact\\data\\README.md"}, {"id": "concept_37021f154edb", "label": "`herb-eval.dump` is a Neo4j dump of `herb-eval`, the v1 artefact graph the `artefact_v1` arm queries (see root `CLAUDE.md`). The native rebuild's graph, `herb-v3`, is a separate, later build", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/data/README.md", "source_location": "c:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\v3\\artefact\\data\\README.md"}, {"id": "artefact_data_readme_restore", "label": "Restore recipe on any machine with Neo4j installed: `neo4j-admin database load herb-eval --from-path=<dir containing this file>`, then start the database and set `NEO4J_URI` / `NEO4J_PASSWORD` for whichever arm reads it (`pipelines/artefact_v1.py`)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/data/README.md", "source_location": "c:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\v3\\artefact\\data\\README.md"}], "edges": [{"source": "document_8ab55efe4f14", "target": "concept_37021f154edb", "relation": "contains", "source_file": "v3/artefact/data/README.md"}, {"source": "document_8ab55efe4f14", "target": "artefact_data_readme_restore", "relation": "contains", "source_file": "v3/artefact/data/README.md"}, {"source": "concept_37021f154edb", "target": "pipelines_artefact_v1_rationale_1", "relation": "related_to", "source_file": "v3/artefact/data/README.md"}, {"source": "concept_37021f154edb", "target": "pipelines_artefact_v1_det_rationale_1", "relation": "related_to", "source_file": "v3/artefact/data/README.md"}, {"source": "concept_37021f154edb", "target": "artefact_graph_store_rationale_1", "relation": "related_to", "source_file": "v3/artefact/data/README.md"}, {"source": "concept_37021f154edb", "target": "claude_md_artefact_arm_v1", "relation": "related_to", "so